  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen Community in Sea Turtle Conservation and Reinforce Stakeholder Network to effect policy, Andhra Pradesh and Odisha, India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will continue a community based sea turtle nest protection program along 170 km of nesting beaches on the Bay of Bengal, involving 60 villages and conduct outreach programs with fishers to reduce sea turtle bycatch through use of TEDs.</narrative>
